text = "Press the [color=\"yellow\"]E[/color] key while your cursor is over the [color=\"cyan\"]knife[/color] to use it.
While the [color=\"cyan\"]knife[/color] is being used, move your cursor over the [color=\"orange\"]ingredient.[/color]
If a [color=\"yellow\"]yellow line[/color] is showing on its surface, click to cut.
Press [color=\"yellow\"]Z[/color] or [color=\"yellow\"]X[/color] to change the cut axis.
Don't worry if the [color=\"orange\"]ingredient [/color]rolls away."
fit_content = true
autowrap_mode = 0

