text = "Put the [color=\"cyan\"]pot[/color] on the table, then place the [color=\"orange\"]pieces[/color] in the pot.
You can place them one by one, 
or grab the [color=\"cyan\"]board[/color]. While you are holding the [color=\"cyan\"]board[/color] and
your cursor is placed over it, press [color=\"yellow\"]E[/color] and click to [color=\"yellow\"]tip[/color] the board and make
its contents fall off. You can do this with other containers too.
This makes spilling something a lot more likely, so be careful!"
fit_content = true
